        "Description": "Edward Carlisle is better at piano than you are. You don&apos;t like other people being better than you at things.\r\rOut of spite, you decide to kill Mr. Carlisle, his best friend Ralph, and his favorite butler, Mr. Fernsby.\r\rAlso, since you like being stylish, you decide to kill them all with a sword.\r\rDon&apos;t get spotted, and good luck!",
